sentences.t:
Tu Tyrrhenum equitem conlatis excipe signis;
tecum acer Messapus erit turmaeque Latinae
Tiburtique manus, ducis et tu concipe curam.”

sentences.l:
You the Tyrrhenian horseman, with standards brought together, receive;
with you keen Messapus will be, and the Latin squadrons,
and Tiburtus' band; of a leader you too take on the charge.”
